9:["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","h1",null,{"id":"sessions","children":"Sessions"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["One handle, one fresh tab, in a browser the engine never\nowns. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"open"}]," connects — per-call ",["$","code",null,{"children":"--cdp"}]," (your driver skill\nknows it), else an answering agent-browser daemon, else\nloopback 9222/9229 — and fails loud naming the fix when\nnothing answers. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"close"}]," drops the\nsession and closes its tab; the browser itself is never\ntouched."]}],"\n",["$","$L10",null,{"code":"agent-webmcp open https://example.com\n# {\"handle\":\"s_…\",\"url\":\"…\",\"toolCount\":0,\n#  \"reapplied\":[],\"skipped\":[]}","lang":"bash"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"toolCount"}]," is point-in-time: pages expose tools as they\nload, so ",["$","code",null,{"children":"0"}]," means list again, not give up. Records live\nunder the OS temp sessions dir and are stale-safe — a\ndead browser surfaces as a transport failure on the\nnext verb, never as a corrupt store. Tabs the browser\nlost are pruned on the next open; records pinned to an\nexplicit endpoint are left alone."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Every ",["$","code",null,{"children":"open"}]," needs a reachable browser. Every open creates a fresh tab —\nnever adopts an existing one — so parallel sessions never\ncollide. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"--cdp"}]," aims per call; an answering agent-browser\ndaemon is borrowed automatically. No endpoint is stored\nanywhere — the driver feeds it, discovery finds the rest."]}],"\n",["$","$L10",null,{"code":"agent-webmcp open --cdp http://127.0.0.1:9222 https://example.com\n# fresh tab in that browser, closed with the session","lang":"bash"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Nothing is ever signaled: no kills, no profile removal, no\nshutdown. The browser is not ours."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"close-discipline","children":"Close discipline"}],"\n",["$","$L10",null,{"code":"agent-webmcp close <handle> --yes   # {closed:[handle]}\nagent-webmcp close --all --yes      # {closed[], failed[]}","lang":"bash"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Close drops the record and closes its tab; the browser\nitself is untouched. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"--all"}]," never aborts on one dead\nbrowser; failures land in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"failed[]"}]," with per-handle\nreasons. Close what you open."]}]],null,["$","$L11",null,{"children":["$","$12",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@13"}]}]]}]
